# Admin Dashboard — Current Status & Conventions

> **Status (2026-07-17):** The original critical/medium bug list, “7 hidden pages”, high/medium missing pages, mobile breakpoint gaps, and missing API helpers from the old audit are **resolved**. Do not re-implement those items. Prefer `navConfig.ts`, modular `src/api/*`, and existing pages under `pages/`.

## Project Structure

```
apps/admin-dashboard/src/
├── api/                      # Modular API clients (re-exported from api/index.ts)
├── App.tsx                   # Router with all routes
├── main.tsx                  # Entry point
├── index.css                 # Global styles + mobile breakpoints + z-index scale
├── components/
│   ├── Layout.tsx            # Shell; nav from navConfig.ts
│   ├── navConfig.ts          # Sidebar groups, permissions, pinned items
│   ├── SharedUI.tsx          # PageHeader, StatCard, Btn, Modal, etc.
│   ├── ErrorBoundary.tsx
│   └── ui/                   # Badge, Button, Card, Modal, etc.
├── hooks/
│   ├── usePageTitle.ts
│   └── usePermissions.ts
└── pages/                    # Route pages (gift cards, reviews, specials, refunds,
                              # waste, inventory, tables, shifts, time-clock, devices,
                              # referrals, xero, print-jobs, etc.)
```

Backend API routes:
- `backend/routes/api.php` — bootstraps domain route files
- `backend/routes/domains/*.php` — feature routes (orders, finance, marketing, inventory, kitchen, …)

